package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])

# The AIA pay-app Connect app is a sibling tree. Bazel does not build a
# WorkOS binary here; it holds the pack builder to the catalog, to
# Project /billing and /budget cites, and to the refusals the issue named.
#
# ⭐ THE GRANT PATH CALLS CONNECTAPIURL. fetch/deliver present a token. WorkOS dashboard registration stays leftover #22. A licensed AIA PDF is refused.
